{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/8763b276b45bcaa9d42bb9c7638fdd70404e7f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> , then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/31712fdd01fcc4064f79979dfad8b4f7d9b83ab1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^y y^x}{y^y x^x}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"59\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/565b7facc7e84a57b2b6652b9cc4188dc87a0a6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } (x-y)^{y/x}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{x-y}\\quad \\text{(C) } 1\\quad \\text{(D) } \\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{y-x}\\quad \\text{(E) } (x-y)^{x/y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"529\" height=\"44\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that this fraction can easily be factored as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/b/cdbdd0051b736b2898bd216c92afa42d585accaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^y}{y^y}\\times\\frac{y^x}{x^x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"65\" height=\"40\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/a/cdaea2f16a817fd1611789800ab298898866c042.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y^x}{x^x}=\\frac{x^{-x}}{y^{-x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" />, this fraction is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/6/0e66b8fd5168175d8e5d7bb5d25899a4e0ab02f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^y\\times\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{-x}=\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{y-x}\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"219\" height=\"44\" />, which corresponds to answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a hr